<title>THAILAND: Dhana Siam Finance 1996 net profit down.</title>
<headline>Dhana Siam Finance 1996 net profit down.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited financial results for Dhana Siam Finance for the year ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				     For 12 months</p>
<p>				   1996	  1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 4.19	  6.77</p>
<p>    Net		     1,073.61    1,425.70</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Dhana Siam Finance and Securities.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
